{
  "title": "ISic003009. Dedication to Damater(?)",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy 2018-03-13, 2021-10-06 (Prag)</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Δάματρι\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Δάματρι\"><span data-text=\"Δάματρι\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"\">Δάμ̣[ατρι]</span></span></span>  <span data-text=\"καὶ\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"\">[καὶ]</span>  <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Κόραι\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Κόραι\"><span data-text=\"Κόραι\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"\">[Κόραι]</span></span></span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"βασιλέυς\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"\">βασιλ[έυς?]</span>  <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Γέλων\n                    βασιλέος Ἱερωνος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Γέλων\"><span data-text=\"Γέλων\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"\">[Γέλων?]</span></span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"βασιλέος\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"\">βασι[λέος?]</span>  <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἱερωνος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Ἱερωνος\"><span data-text=\"Ἱερωνος\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"\">[Ἱερωνος?]</span></span></span></span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy 2018-03-13, 2021-10-06 (Prag)</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Δάματρι\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Δάματρι\"><span data-text=\"Δάματρι\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"\">ΔΑ.[....</span></span></span><span data-text=\"καὶ\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"\">...</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Κόραι\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Κόραι\"><span data-text=\"Κόραι\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"\">.....]</span></span></span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"βασιλέυς\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"\">ΒΑΣΙΛ[...</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Γέλων\n                    βασιλέος Ἱερωνος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Γέλων\"><span data-text=\"Γέλων\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"\">.....]</span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"βασιλέος\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"\">ΒΑΣΙ[....</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἱερωνος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Ἱερωνος\"><span data-text=\"Ἱερωνος\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"\">.......]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic003009_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; Photo J. Prag 2018\" src=\"ISic003009_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003009.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; Photo J. Prag 2018\" src=\"ISic003009-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic003009_scale_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; Photo J. Prag 2021-10-06\" src=\"ISic003009_scale_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003009_scale.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; Photo J. Prag 2021-10-06\" src=\"ISic003009_scale-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic003009_left_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; Photo J. Prag 2021-10-06\" src=\"ISic003009_left_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003009_left.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; Photo J. Prag 2021-10-06\" src=\"ISic003009_left-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic003009_top_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; Photo J. Prag 2021-10-06\" src=\"ISic003009_top_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003009_top.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; Photo J. Prag 2021-10-06\" src=\"ISic003009_top-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text from autopsy</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"4\">4: <span>Manganaro: Συρακόσιοι</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>To Damater and Kore</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The text is speculatively restored in several different ways by previous editors: the primary difference being whether the dedicants are thought to be the royal individual named in line 2 (and perhaps also three, if not a filiation) (so Gentili, Dimartino), or whether the royal name in line 2 is instead the honorand in the accusative, with the subject then named in a shorter (and smaller) line 4 (so Manganaro). It is notable that no editor has yet considered the possibility that the dedicant might be a queen (presumably Philistis wife of Hieron II), rather than Nereis, wife of Gelon), not a king, or even the king and queen jointly.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Gentili 1959-1960 19-20 fig.2 </li><li> Gentili 1961 8-10 no.3 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001955\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001955</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1963 24 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001848\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001848</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1965 186 no.2 tav.64 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001841\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001841</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1965 315 n.11 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001840\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001840</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1977 155-156 dr ph <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001440\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001440</a>  </li><li> 1984 34.0979 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a>  </li><li> 2006 56.1103.2.2 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a>  </li><li> Dimartino 2006 no.2.2 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002022\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002022</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> <p>Thinly incised broad letters of regular height, without serifs or marked terminations to the strokes. Alpha has straight bar; Beta has closed loops, in the second instance separated from one another. Sigma has parallel top and bottom strokes, the mid-strokes meeting slightly over halfway across.</p> <p> Types list: <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Α-type1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Α type1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Α-type1.3.html\" target=\"_blank\">Α type1.3</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Β-type2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Β type2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Β-type2.1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Β type2.1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ι-type1.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ι type1</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Σ-tyoe3.2.html\" target=\"_blank\">Σ type3.2</a> <a href=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Σ-type3.html\" target=\"_blank\">Σ type3</a> </p> Line 1-3  60  Interlineation line 1 to 2  not measured  </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
